      "description": "Current page and inactive page treatment.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"Navigasi contoh\"><a class=\"ds-nav-link\" href=\"#dashboard\" aria-current=\"page\">Dashboard</a><a class=\"ds-nav-link\" href=\"#transactions\">Transaksi</a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{display:flex;gap:.25rem;}.ds-nav-link{font-family:\"Manrope\",\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;display:inline-flex;min-height:2.75rem;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:.625rem .875rem;border-radius:var(--radius-control);color:var(--muted);font-size:.875rem;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;}.ds-nav-link:hover{background:var(--muted-bg);color:var(--foreground);}.ds-nav-link[aria-current=\"page\"]{background:var(--accent-bg);color:var(--primary);}.ds-nav-link:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:3px;}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:no-preference){.ds-nav-link{transition:background-color 160ms ease,color 160ms ease;position:relative;}.ds-nav-link[aria-current=\"page\"]::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;bottom:.25rem;width:1rem;height:2px;background:currentColor;border-radius:1rem;}}"
